stamp.ts drawStamp now draws:
- the large see-through words in the middle;
- the words again, small and dark, in rows along both diagonals over the whole page, corners included. The colour is rgb(0.5,0.07,0.05) at 0.85, which stays below half-grey;
- the words at the bottom of the page as well as the top.
New markFields frames each signature, initials and stamp, crosses it and writes the word inside. renderEnvelopePdf has an `unfinished` option: copies of an envelope still out say NOT COMPLETED YET / NOT EVERYONE HAS SIGNED this way. buildPdf defaults it on. The stored copy of what someone signed before a change is built without it, because withNotice marks it.
After the fix, threshold.cjs gives 4492 mark pixels surviving the 50% threshold and 3203 in the lower right. Renders are tests/out/repair-disputes/voided-2.png, voided-2-bw.png and early-1.png. P8 early_copy_marked is now true.

- CHAIN_TRUTH now says the chain head covers lines up to completion only.
- The certificate page now says:
  - the closed mark is on every copy made after closing, plus the NOT COMPLETED YET copies, with the layers described and what drawn marks cannot prove;
  - Sender is the login holding the envelope at completion (hand-over noted);
  - Chain head does not cover later lines;
  - it adds Witness, Witnessed and the witness lines.
- The security page says a dispute line has no IP or browser.

